¡Notable for their magnificent, jewel-like color illustrations by Bilibin, these traditional tales include "The Frog Princess," "Vassilissa the Beautiful," and "The White Duck." Though Russian Fairy Talesin the Pantheon Folklore Library is a book for adults, it has sold over 30,000 copies."®
«Illustrations by Tullio Pericoli. A lively collection of classic zingers from the mouths and pens of authors. "Who's better at being nasty than writers on other writers?"--The New York Times Magazine. A BOOK-OF-THE-MONTH CLUB and WRITER'S DIGEST BOOK CLUB selection. Illustrations by Tullio Pericoli"¼

¹
Ena sunonthuleuma demosiographon mias kathemerines ephemeridas pou de noiazetai toso gia ten plerophoria oso gia ekbiasmous, laspologies kai phtenes istories. Enas paranoikos suntaktes pou anabionei penenta khronia Istorias upo to phos mias satanikes plektanes me epikentro to ptoma enos pseuto-Mousolini se aposunthese. Stis skies paramoneuei e mustike dexia Epikheirese Gladio, e masonike Stoa R2, to praxikopema tou prigkipa Tzounio Balerio Mporgkeze, e CIA, kai eikosi khronia sphages kai sugkalupses. Mia khliare istoria agapes anamesa se enan apotukhemeno aphane suggraphea kai ena enokhletiko koritsi to opoio, gia na boethesei ten oikogeneia tou, ekhei paratesei to panepistemio kai askholeitai me ta roz koutsompolia. Ena teleio egkheiridio kakes demosiographias, opou o anagnostes arkhizei siga siga na anarotietai an prokeitai gia muthoplasia e piste apotupose tes pragmatikotetas. Mia istoria pou ektulissetai to 1992 -khronia pou prooionisteke polla musteria kai aperiskepsies ton epomenon eikosi eton-akribos te stigme pou oi duo protagonistes nomizan oti o ephialtes eikhe teleiosei. Ena pikro kai gkrotesko epeisodio pou lambanei khora sten Europe kata ten periodo meta te lexe tou polemou kai phtanei mekhri to semera - ena epeisodio pou tha kanei ton anagnoste na aisthanthei toso khamenos oso kai oi duo protagonistes."İ-
Ú-"Gurisa astrapiaia, me ta dakhtula mou na sphiggontai guro apo te labe tou mpastouniou mou. Ekei, ste mese tes phardias, photismenes apo to pheggari demosias, ekei -san na eikhe xepedesei ekeine te stigme mesa apo te ge e na eikhe pesei apo ton ourano- stekotan mia monakhike gunaika, ntumene apo ten koruphe os ta nukhia me leuka roukha, me to prosopo tes na koitaxei erotematika to diko mou kai to kheri tes na deikhnei to skoteino sunnepho pano apo to Londino.(...) E allokote gunaika milese prote. "Autos einai o dromos gia to Londino;" eipe.
(...) Ti eidous gunaika etan, kai pos eikhe tukhei na brethei olomonakhe ste demosia, mia ora meta ta mesanukhta, mou etan teleios adunaton na to mantepso..."
"E gunaika me ta aspra" anekei ste sugkinesiake logotekhnia, enan eureias apekheses klado tes biktorianes muthistoriographias, o opoios sunduase tis sugkineseis tes mesaionikes logotekhnias me ton psukhologiko realismo tes sugkhrones thematographias. Me aparamillo aphegematiko stul, o Collins kai oi mimetes tou metepheran te phrike tou mesaionikou muthistorematos apo ta moukhliasmena italika kastra sta salonia kai tis trapezaries mias sugkhrones mesoastikes diktorianes Agglias. Periegrapsan mian Agglia gemate apo zophera egklemata, pou kathelonan tous anagnostes ton laikon ephemeridon. Opos kharakteristika skholiase argotera o Henry James: "Ston Collins prepei na pistothei e eisagoge ste muthistoriographia ton pleon apisteuton musterion, auton pou karadokoun exo apo tis portes mas".
Musterio kai atmosphaira, erotes, phantasmata, arrosties, prodosies kai e austere kai gemate oikogeneiaka egklemata agglike koinonia sto muthistorema <>tou Gouiliam Gouilki Kolins.
San ton palio, kalo kairo, akribos. Exallou katholou tukhaio, kati mou thumize! <>tou Gouiliam Gouilki Kolins pou kuklophorese apo tis ekdoseis <>stous <>. Ena ogkodes biblio, grammeno to 1860, pou emperiekhei ta panta: erota, musterio, te biktoriane epokhe, ethographia, aristotekhnike ploke, endiapherousa glossa pou ten kathista apolutos sugkhrone kai spartariste e exairetike metaphrase tou Errikou Mpartzinopoulou kai pou, pano ap ola, ekphrazei mia oloklere epokhe. Mian epokhe pou exere kai ti einai kai pos graphetai ena alethino muthistorema.
Exallou e ebdomadiaia dokimasia (demosieuotan se sunekheies sto periodiko tou Karolou Ntikens) to ethete upo diarke anagnostike krise. Tora, pou alla ethe, alloi ruthmoi, poios tolma na buthistei se 828 selidon oikogeneiake upothese, musterio, epokhe.
E gunaika me ta aspra pou kathorizei ton titlo kai ten upothese, kineitai os phantasma, san skia sten istoria, me ten emphanise tes omos to apan xekina. O daskalos zographikes Gouolter Khartrait pephtei kuriolektika pano tes kai te boetha na xephugei. Apo tous dioktes tes tha plerophorethei oti einai e An Katherik kai ekhei drapeteusei ap to asulo opou ten ekhei kleisei <>o lordos Persibal Gklaint. E zoe tha ta pherei etsi, e mallon o dexiotekhnes suggrapheus, oste na brethei daskalos zographikes tes Lora Pherli kai tes eterothalous adelphes tes Marian Khalkomp, na eroteuthei te Lora ki ekplektos na blepei oti einai upokhreomene na pantreutei ton lordo Persibal Gklaint, diapistonontas tautokhronos kai ten apisteute omoioteta tes me ten egkleiste An Katherik!
E kataigistike ploke pou akolouthei, tha pherei ton anagnoste apo ekplexe se ekplexe, ephoson o kathe eroas tha akolouthesei te dike tou eparkos moiraia diadrome: E Lora Pherli tha ginei tragike laide Gklaint, e An Katherik pou phora diarkos aspra kai eikhe perasei ta paidika tes khronia mazi me te Lora, tha iskhuristei oti einai katokhos enos phoberou mustikou pou tha tromokratesei ton lordo Klaint othontas ton se akraies egklematikes praxeis, me sunenokho te theia tes Lora kai ton andra tes, ena musteriode, antiphatiko tupo, ton kome Phosko. Periplaneseis, musterio, phantasmata, arrosties, e austere kai gemate oikogeneiaka egklemata kai mustika agglike koinonia, mustikes adelphotetes, prodosies, tha ektulissontai mpros ta ekplekta matia mas me tropo apolutos natouralistiko, atmosphairiko kai me euphuestate aphegematike dome: e aphegese kula me te methodo tes skutalodromias, apo ton Gouolter Khartrait kai te Marion Khalkomp, ston dikegoro tes oikogeneias, sten oikonomo tou spitiou, ste nosokoma, akoma kai ston Phrenterik Pherli, ton paronta - aponta theio pou upokhreonetai kapoia stigme na phanerothei alla kai apo ton kome Phosko upo te morphe mias, upodeigmatikou uphous kai aparamillou stul, epistoles. Aute e epistole tha xetulixei me tropo anaiskhunto kai olo to egklematiko koubari, e istoria ekhei pros terpse ton anagnoston khapi ent kai e diadrome sou prospherei agonia, apolause, mian epokhe kai ena aparamillo stul graphes, sto piato.
Oi aretes, oles autes tou paliou kalou khortastikou klasikou muthistorematos: Mallia koubaria e ploke, musterio kai atmosphaira, olozontanoi kharakteres, spartariste epokhe, na apodeiknuei oti e logotekhnia sukhna diasozei to parelthon, ten koinonia kai ten Istoria. Prospherontas mas ten pio anagluphe tes morphe.
Dexiotekhnes tes aphegeses o Kolins, den aphenei oute seiroula na pesei kato kai me exairetike oikonomia khresimopoiei tous pantes kai ta panta, denontas ten prote me ten teleutaia skene.
Teleionontas thumetheka kai ti mou... thumizei! Te <>pou kapote akouga ta proina magemene sto radiophono kai te manoula mou na me phonazei gero-Pherli, ap ekeinon ton gero-paraxeno pou ethele mono ten esukhia tou (opos ten ethela nukhthemeron gia na diabazo ki ego). Kai ten uperokhe <>pou ekho akoma ste bibliotheke apo te <>.
Apo tis semantikoteres stigmes tou bibliou, e omoioteta ton duo eroidon pou odegei kai sten antallage tautoteton, e ainigmatike phigoura tes asprophoremenes An Katherik, o daimonikos goeteutikos komes Phosko kai e tekhnike tes aphegeses, apo eroa se eroa, kai eniote uposterizontas alla, diaphoretike."ğ
íTo muthistorema "Ola ta onomata" kuklophorese enan khrono protou o Zoze Saramagkou timethei me to Nompel Logotekhnias.
Me te kharakteristike tou proza (megales protaseis kai elakhista semeia stixes), me exupne eironeia kai mesta noemata o suggrapheas mas sustenei ton eroa tou mono me to mikro tou onoma: Zoze.
O Zoze einai enas sunestalmenos meselikos ergenes pou douleuei sto lexiarkheio kapoias poles. Katoikei dipla sto lexiarkheio kai e kathemerinoteta tou einai mounte kai peristoikhismene apo ola auta ta onomata anthropon pou gennethekan , pantreutekan , pethanan .
To mono pathos tou Zoze einai na sullegei apokommata ephemeridon me demosieumata pou aphoroun diasemotetes. Kathe bradu mpainei krupha sto lexiarkheio kai phtiakhnei antigrapha ton pistopoietikon genneseos auton ton diasemoteton ta opoia taxinomei kai arkheiothetei. Epi 20 khronia kanei aute te douleia ospou mia mera pephtei sta kheria tou to pistopoietiko genneseos mias agnostes 36khrones gunaikas kai e zoe tou xaphnika allazei.
O Zoze bgainei apo te thlibere routina tou prospathontas na mathei oso mporei perissotera gia te zoe autes tes gunaikas. O allote apsogos upallelos Khresimopoiei akome kai paranomes methodous gia na epitukhei ton skopo tou. Tha brei arage o Zoze ten agnoste; Kai ti tha ginei an te brei;
O Saramagkou graphei ten istoria tou me sapheneia kai aploteta dinontas onoma sten anthropine monaxia. Oloi mas ekhoume anagke apo te suntrophia tou allou. Oloi mas, oso metriotetes kai an eimaste, kapoio krupho pathos tha ekhoume pou dunetika mporei na mas kanei na xephugoume apo te mizere kathemerinoteta mas.
(ephemerida "La Repubblica", Italia)"ı
úOpos o nautes sta xartia glistrese pano ston tropiko
tou Karkinou kai ston tropiko tou Aigokero
ki etan polu phusiko pou den mporouse na stamatesei
mprosta mas sto upsos anthropou
alla mas koitaze olous apo to upsos tes pugolampidas
e apo to upsos tou peukou
pairnontas bathia ten anasa tou ste drosia ton astron
e ste skone tes ges.
Ton peristoikhizan gumnes gunaikes me mprountzina phulla
araposukias
sbesmenoi phanostates anemizontas tous kelidomenous
epidesmous tes megales politeias
asummetra kormia gennobolontas kentaurous kai amazones
san aggizan ta mallia tous to Galaxia.
(Giorgos Sepheres apospasma apo to poiema "Les Anges sont blancs", aphieromeno ston Khenri Miler).
To aristourgema tou Khenri Miler, ena muthistorema pou exakolouthei na skandalizei. O suggrapheas periplanietai sto phantasmagoriko Parisi tou Mesopolemou kai mesa apo polles mikres kai megales peripeteies kai spartaristes erotikes drasteriotetes anakaluptei ton idio tou ton eauto kai to bathutero pseudos tou kosmou pou ton periballei."ı
úE Lismpet Salanter, idiophuia stous upologistes, de distazei mprosta se tipota prokeimenou na petukhei to stokho tes. Den xekhna kai de sugkhorei, kai otan sunanta diaphthora kai kakopoiese, idios apenanti se gunaikes, einai aneleete.
Kerussontas polemo s' autous pou kinoun ta nemata tes biomekhanias tou emporiou sarkos khresimopoiei tis ikanotetes tes os khaker gia na boethesei sten ereuna pou ekhei xekinesei o Mikael Mploumkbist, ekdotes tou periodikou Millennium. Empleketai, omos, athela tes se mia diple dolophonia, eno e astunomia ten kunega kai gia enan trito phono. Ola ta stoikheia ten enokhopoioun kai ta daktulika tes apotupomata ekhoun brethei sto oplo tou egklematos. Kathos oles oi dunameis ste Souedia alla kai apophasismenoi egklematies einai sta ikhne tes, e Lismpet den ekhei alle epiloge: prepei na anakalupsei kai na xeskepasei ten aletheia protou einai arga gia ten idia tes te zoe.
To deutero biblio tes trilogias Millennium pou ekhei sarosei ta brabeia kai ekhei enthousiasei kritikous kai anagnostes se olo ton kosmo. Ena mnemeiodes politikooikonomiko alla kai erotiko thriler pou prokalese aisthese se ole ten Europe!"	
